Z||000000||85 gt fiero||12-10-2001||04:35 PM||||as you all probably know im having troubles with my car it was running great and then when i went to start it up, it started smoking through the exhaust its done it before but stopped after driving it for a few minutes, but it hasnt gone away and it doesnt idle, once i let my foot of the gas it stalls, any suggestions, i have codes 33, and 35, and have a few exhaust manifold bolts broke off but it always ran fine just a little louder. Tahnx in advance  randy<P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES, LIGHT BARS, SCS SUSPENSION, KONI ADJUSTERS,HIGH POINT CUTOFFS, AND BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||1
Z||000001||Blacktree||12-11-2001||01:16 AM||||Just out of curiosity, what kind of smoke is it? Blue smoke? Black smoke? White smoke? Also, does the exhaust smell like fresh gasoline?<P>code 33 = manifold pressure out of spec (MAP sensor)<BR>code 35 = bad idle quality (IAC valve)<P>You might want to check the vacuum hose that connects the MAP sensor to the intake manifold. If the hose is loose or cracked, that could be the problem. Or your MAP sensor could be kaput. Either of these two things would cause a rough idle, which in turn would trigger a code 35.<P>Hope this helps  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||85 gt fiero||12-12-2001||03:27 PM||||thanx ill go check that out.  Randy||||reg||1
Z||000003||tesmith66||12-12-2001||03:48 PM||||How long have the manifold bolts been broken?<P>Let them go too long, and you will burn exhaust valves.<P>I ran with cracked maniflods on my 86 for 3 years (didn't know they were until I disassembled it) and ended up replacing EVERY exhaust valve when I had the heads done. A burnt valve will reduce cylinder compression to the point the engine will idle.<P>------------------<BR>Timothy E. Smith<BR>1986 SE V6<BR>1984 Coupe||||reg||1
Z||000004||85 gt fiero||12-12-2001||05:37 PM||||maybe 6 months at the most, thanx for the help though, i still need some ore help, new engine <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES, LIGHT BARS, SCS SUSPENSION, KONI ADJUSTERS,HIGH POINT CUTOFFS, AND BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||1
